sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Tech as Technicien
    participant Canal as Telegram / WhatsApp
    participant N8N as n8n
    participant API as Service FastAPI
    participant STT as Moteur STT
    participant LLM as Chaine d extraction
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant GS as Google Sheets

    Tech->>Canal: note vocale en darija
    Canal->>N8N: message
    N8N->>API: POST /logs/claim (idempotence)
    API->>PG: INSERT processed_messages
    alt message deja traite
        API-->>N8N: duplicate
        N8N-->>Tech: (silence, deja repondu)
    else message neuf
        N8N->>API: GET /technicians/lookup
        API-->>N8N: personne + profil + autorisation
        N8N->>Canal: accuse de reception
        N8N->>Canal: telechargement du media
        N8N->>API: POST /process (multipart)
        API->>PG: profile_for(technicien)
        API->>STT: transcribe(audio)
        STT-->>API: texte + confiance
        API->>LLM: extraction contrainte par schema
        LLM-->>API: ExtractedReport + resume FR
        API-->>N8N: 200 + avertissements

        rect rgb(230, 245, 233)
        note over N8N,Tech: Ordre reponse-d abord - invariant
        N8N-->>Tech: resume en francais
        end

        alt rapport exploitable
            N8N->>API: POST /journal
            API->>GS: fusion ligne (date, technicien)
            alt Sheets indisponible
                API->>PG: INSERT failed_writes
                API-->>N8N: 502
                note over PG: rejoue toutes les 5 min
            end
        else "salam" - has_data() faux
            note over N8N: aucune ecriture
        end
    end
